# Build brief — PhD portfolio site

**For:** Bernadette, building with Claude Code
**Pairs with:** `DEPLOY_INSTRUCTIONS.md` (hosting and access) and `paper_register_2026-08-25.md` (source content)
**Status of this document:** it is the spec. Hand it to Claude Code as-is.
**Revision:** 3 — ids switched from paper codes (C1, S4…) to name-based slugs, item counts made dynamic instead of hardcoded so the register has room to grow, and the ageing-counter acceptance criterion reworked around real submission/update timelines rather than a fixed to-do example.

This project has two jobs. It is Victor's working tool, and it is a portfolio piece for Bernadette. Those two jobs mostly agree, and Section 11 covers the places where they do not.

