## 6. Behaviour

- Selecting a card sets it as active; selecting it again deselects.
- Filters narrow the grid. If the selected card is filtered out, keep it in the panel — do not clear the selection.
- Filters: **All · First author · Co-author · My move · Blocked**. "My move" is `court === 'victor'`. "Blocked" is `status === 'blocked'` or a non-empty `blockedBy`.
- Deep links: selected id in the URL hash (e.g. `#beta-plane-paldor`), read on load. Victor will paste these into emails.
- Keyboard: cards are real buttons, tab-navigable, Enter/Space selects, Escape deselects, visible focus ring.
- **No animation** beyond a 150ms colour transition on hover and focus. This is a working tool.

